# Input

```svelte
{#await thePromise then theValue}{theValue}{:catch error}{error}{/await}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1 +1,5 @@
-{#await thePromise then theValue}{theValue}{:catch error}{error}{/await}
+{#await thePromise then theValue}
+    {theValue}
+{:catch error}
+    {error}
+{/await}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#await thePromise then theValue}
    {theValue}
{:catch error}
    {error}
{/await}
```
